{"id": "acddfa05-b831-44bf-9405-6548c16996c3", "slug": "synthetic-archives-visualization-continuum-3", "title": "Synthetic Archives - Visualization Continuum", "description": "Synthetic Archives Testimonial Section is designed for showcasing social proof and customer credibility. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Synthetic Archives - Visualization Continuum\"\ndescription: \"Synthetic Archives Testimonial Section is designed for showcasing social proof and customer credibility. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#2563EB\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#2563EB\"\n  background: \"#E4E4E7\"\n  surface: \"#18181A\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#E5E7EB\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Synthetic Archives - Visualization Continuum\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 95; favorites: 9; remixes: 3.\nTags: cta, animated, bento, social-proof, charts, action.\n## Overview\nSynthetic Archives Testimonial Section is designed for showcasing social proof and customer credibility. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nSynthetic Framework Documentation Enterprise Get Started SYNTHETIC ARCHIVES LTD. From abstraction to form. The five stages of realization. A responsive structural framework where spatial data exists on a continuum, from…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: From abstraction to form. The five stages of realization..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #2563EB, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #2563EB, background #E4E4E7, surface #18181A, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and JetBrains Mono for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Synthetic Archives - Visualization Continuum</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <!-- Fonts to match the precise aesthetic -->\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@500;700&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;1,400&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <script>\n        tailwind.config = {\n            theme: {\n                extend: {\n                    fontFamily: {\n                        sans: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'],\n                        serif: ['Playfair Display', 'serif'],\n                        mono: ['JetBrains Mono', 'monospace'],\n                    },\n                    colors: {\n                        brand: {\n                            dark: '#111111',\n                            surface: '#18181A',\n                            accent: '#2563eb'\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    </script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#e4e4e7] min-h-screen w-full flex items-center justify-center px-4 pt-24 pb-12 sm:px-8 sm:pt-28 md:px-12 md:pt-32 font-sans antialiased text-zinc-100 relative overflow-x-hidden selection:bg-brand-accent selection:text-white\">\n\n    <!-- Top Menu -->\n    <nav class=\"fixed top-0 left-0 w-full h-16 z-50 bg-[#e4e4e7]/80 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-zinc-300/50 flex items-center justify-between px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-24 transition-all duration-300\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-brand-dark font-mono text-xs md:text-sm font-bold tracking-[0.1em] uppercase\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:box-linear\" class=\"text-xl\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n            <span>Synthetic</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-8 text-[13px] font-medium text-zinc-600\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-brand-dark transition-colors duration-200\">Framework</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-brand-dark transition-colors duration-200\">Documentation</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-brand-dark transition-colors duration-200\">Enterprise</a>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs font-medium bg-brand-dark text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-sm shadow-sm hover:bg-black transition-colors duration-200 uppercase tracking-wide\">\n                Get Started\n            </a>\n        </div>\n    </nav>\n\n    <!-- Background Container Lines -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none z-0 flex justify-between px-8 md:px-24 mt-16\">\n        <div class=\"w-[1px] h-full bg-zinc-300/50 relative\">\n            <div class=\"absolute top-8 -left-1 w-2 h-2 border border-zinc-400 bg-[#e4e4e7]\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-8 -left-1 w-2 h-2 border border-zinc-400 bg-[#e4e4e7]\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"hidden md:block w-[1px] h-full bg-zinc-300/30\"></div>\n        <div class=\"w-[1px] h-full bg-zinc-300/50 relative\">\n            <div class=\"absolute top-8 -left-1 w-2 h-2 border border-zinc-400 bg-[#e4e4e7]\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-8 -left-1 w-2 h-2 border border-zinc-400 bg-[#e4e4e7]\"></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Wrapping Container for Content and Social Proof -->\n    <div class=\"w-full max-w-[1200px] flex flex-col gap-6 z-10 relative\">\n\n        <!-- Main Card with Border Gradient -->\n        <div class=\"relative w-full h-[85vh] max-h-[800px] min-h-[600px] rounded-sm overflow-hidden shadow-2xl shadow-black/20 group\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.4) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 50%, rgba(0,0,0,0.4) 100%); padding: 1px;\">\n\n            <div class=\"w-full h-full bg-brand-surface rounded-sm overflow-hidden flex flex-col md:flex-row relative\">\n\n                <!-- Left Panel (Content) -->\n                <div class=\"w-full md:w-[38%] h-full bg-brand-dark p-8 md:p-12 lg:p-16 flex flex-col justify-between relative z-20 shadow-[10px_0_30px_-10px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)]\">\n\n                    <!-- Header -->\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col items-start space-y-16\">\n                        <div class=\"inline-block bg-zinc-200 text-brand-dark px-2.5 py-1 text-[9px] font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-bold\">\n                            SYNTHETIC ARCHIVES LTD.\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"space-y-6\">\n                            <h1 id=\"hero-title\" class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-[42px] font-serif leading-[1.1] tracking-tight text-white font-medium\">\n                                From abstraction to form. The five stages of realization.\n                            </h1>\n                            <p class=\"text-xs md:text-[13px] text-zinc-400 font-sans leading-relaxed max-w-[90%]\">\n                                A responsive structural framework where spatial data exists on a continuum, from raw point clouds to full photorealistic environments. Slide the timeline to observe how architectural logic evolves across states. Elements blend seamlessly as you transition.\n                            </p>\n\n                            <!-- CTA Injection -->\n                            <div class=\"pt-4\">\n                                <a href=\"#\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white text-brand-dark px-6 py-3 text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wide hover:bg-zinc-200 transition-colors duration-200 shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(255,255,255,0.1)]\">\n                                    Initialize Framework\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                                </a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Interactive Slider Area -->\n                    <div class=\"w-full mt-12 pb-2\">\n                        <!-- Custom Slider Element -->\n                        <div id=\"fidelity-slider\" class=\"relative h-6 w-full cursor-pointer flex items-center group/slider touch-none\">\n                            <!-- Background Track -->\n                            <div class=\"absolute left-0 right-0 h-[1px] bg-zinc-800 transition-colors group-hover/slider:bg-zinc-700\"></div>\n                            <!-- Active Track -->\n                            <div id=\"slider-fill\" class=\"absolute left-0 h-[1px] bg-zinc-400 w-1/2 transition-colors\"></div>\n                            <!-- Thumb -->\n                            <div id=\"slider-thumb\" class=\"absolute left-1/2 w-3.5 h-3.5 bg-zinc-100 rounded-full -translate-x-1/2 shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(255,255,255,0.2)] hover:scale-125 transition-transform duration-200 z-10\"></div>\n\n                            <!-- Invisible Hit Area for easier dragging -->\n                            <div class=\"absolute inset-y-[-10px] inset-x-0 bg-transparent\"></div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Labels -->\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-between w-full mt-5 relative\">\n                            <span class=\"slider-label text-[8px] md:text-[9px] font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-zinc-600 transition-colors duration-300\">POINT CLOUD</span>\n                            <span class=\"slider-label text-[8px] md:text-[9px] font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-zinc-600 transition-colors duration-300\">WIREFRAME</span>\n                            <span class=\"slider-label text-[8px] md:text-[9px] font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-white font-bold transition-colors duration-300 relative\">\n                                HYBRID\n                                <!-- Small dot indicator below active label -->\n                                <div class=\"absolute -bottom-3 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-1 h-1 bg-white rounded-full opacity-100 transition-opacity\"></div>\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"slider-label text-[8px] md:text-[9px] font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-zinc-600 transition-colors duration-300\">TEXTURED</span>\n                            <span class=\"slider-label text-[8px] md:text-[9px] font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-zinc-600 transition-colors duration-300\">PHOTOREAL</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Right Panel (Image & Dither & Stars) -->\n                <div class=\"w-full md:w-[62%] h-full relative overflow-hidden bg-black flex-1\">\n\n                    <!-- Base Image Layer -->\n                    <img id=\"base-image\"\n                        src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/5ee0a38a-b5d3-4531-8793-98beed4af162_1600w.jpg\"\n                        alt=\"Futuristic Architecture\"\n                        class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover transition-all duration-75 ease-linear\"\n                        style=\"filter: grayscale(50%) contrast(1.1) brightness(0.9);\" />\n\n                    <!-- 1px Dither Pattern Mask Layer -->\n                    <div id=\"dither-layer\"\n                        class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none mix-blend-screen transition-opacity duration-75 ease-linear\"\n                        style=\"\n                            background-image:\n                                linear-gradient(45deg, #2563eb 25%, transparent 25%, transparent 75%, #2563eb 75%, #2563eb),\n                                linear-gradient(45deg, #2563eb 25%, transparent 25%, transparent 75%, #2563eb 75%, #2563eb);\n                            background-size: 2px 2px;\n                            background-position: 0 0, 1px 1px;\n                            opacity: 0.8;\n                        \">\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Falling Stars Overlay (Top Left to Bottom Right) -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-30 pointer-events-none overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center mix-blend-screen opacity-90\">\n                        <div class=\"w-[250%] h-[250%] absolute rotate-45 flex flex-col justify-center gap-32 md:gap-48\">\n                            <!-- Star 1 -->\n                            <div class=\"star-wrapper w-full flex items-center justify-start h-[2px]\">\n                                <div class=\"w-32 md:w-48 h-[2px] bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent to-white relative rounded-full ml-[15%]\">\n                                    <div class=\"absolute right-0 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-white shadow-[0_0_10px_2px_#fff] rounded-full\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <!-- Star 2 -->\n                            <div class=\"star-wrapper w-full flex items-center justify-start h-[4px]\">\n                                <div class=\"w-48 md:w-64 h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent to-brand-accent relative rounded-full ml-[35%] opacity-80\">\n                                    <div class=\"absolute right-0 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-2 h-2 bg-brand-accent shadow-[0_0_12px_3px_#2563eb] rounded-full\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <!-- Star 3 -->\n                            <div class=\"star-wrapper w-full flex items-center justify-start h-[1px]\">\n                                <div class=\"w-24 md:w-32 h-[1px] bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent to-white/80 relative rounded-full ml-[5%]\">\n                                    <div class=\"absolute right-0 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[2px] h-[2px] bg-white shadow-[0_0_8px_1px_#fff] rounded-full\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Additional subtle vignette to blend edges -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none z-40\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(circle at center, transparent 40%, rgba(0,0,0,0.6) 100%);\"></div>\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Social Proof Grid Box below -->\n        <div class=\"w-full relative border border-zinc-300/50 bg-[#e4e4e7]/60 backdrop-blur-sm p-5 sm:p-6 md:px-12 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.4) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.0) 100%);\">\n            <!-- Framed Grid L-brackets -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-2 h-2 border-t border-l border-zinc-400\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-2 h-2 border-t border-r border-zinc-400\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-2 h-2 border-b border-l border-zinc-400\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-2 h-2 border-b border-r border-zinc-400\"></div>\n\n            <span class=\"text-[9px] font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-zinc-500 font-bold text-center md:text-left shrink-0\">Employed by visionary structural studios</span>\n\n            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center flex-wrap gap-6 sm:gap-12 text-zinc-500\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 hover:text-zinc-800 transition-colors cursor-pointer\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:buildings-linear\" class=\"text-xl\"></iconify-icon><span class=\"text-xs font-serif font-medium tracking-tight\">Kengo & Co</span></div>\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 hover:text-zinc-800 transition-colors cursor-pointer\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:city-linear\" class=\"text-xl\"></iconify-icon><span class=\"text-xs font-serif font-medium tracking-tight\">Hadid Studio</span></div>\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 hover:text-zinc-800 transition-colors cursor-pointer\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:home-angle-linear\" class=\"text-xl\"></iconify-icon><span class=\"text-xs font-serif font-medium tracking-tight\">Foster Labs</span></div>\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 hover:text-zinc-800 transition-colors cursor-pointer\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:smart-home-linear\" class=\"text-xl\"></iconify-icon><span class=\"text-xs font-serif font-medium tracking-tight\">Bjarke Nexus</span></div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", () => {\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            // --- 1. Masked Word Reveal Animation ---\n            const titleElement = document.getElementById('hero-title');\n            const text = titleElement.innerText;\n            titleElement.innerHTML = '';\n\n            // Wrap words for GSAP masking\n            const words = text.split(' ');\n            words.forEach(word => {\n                const wrapper = document.createElement('span');\n                wrapper.className = 'inline-block overflow-hidden align-bottom mr-[0.25em] mb-[0.05em] pt-[0.1em]';\n                const inner = document.createElement('span');\n                inner.className = 'inline-block transform translate-y-[110%] opacity-0';\n                inner.innerText = word;\n                wrapper.appendChild(inner);\n                titleElement.appendChild(document.createTextNode(' '));\n            });\n\n            // Animate words\n            gsap.to('#hero-title span span', {\n                y: 0,\n                opacity: 1,\n                duration: 1.2,\n                stagger: 0.04,\n                ease: 'power4.out',\n                delay: 0.3\n            });\n\n            // --- 2. Falling Stars Animation ---\n            gsap.utils.toArray('.star-wrapper').forEach((star, i) => {\n                gsap.fromTo(star,\n                    { xPercent: -100 },\n                    { xPercent: 100, duration: 2.5 + (i * 1.2), repeat: -1, ease: \"none\", delay: i * 0.5 }\n                );\n            });\n\n            // --- 3. Custom Slider & Dither Logic ---\n            const slider = document.getElementById('fidelity-slider');\n            const thumb = document.getElementById('slider-thumb');\n            const fill = document.getElementById('slider-fill');\n            const labels = document.querySelectorAll('.slider-label');\n\n            const baseImg = document.getElementById('base-image');\n            const ditherLayer = document.getElementById('dither-layer');\n\n            let isDragging = false;\n\n            // Set initial state (50% - Hybrid)\n            let currentPercent = 0.5;\n\n            function updateUI(percent) {\n                // Constrain 0 to 1\n                percent = Math.max(0, Math.min(1, percent));\n\n                // Update Slider Visuals\n                thumb.style.left = `${percent * 100}%`;\n                fill.style.width = `${percent * 100}%`;\n\n                // Update Labels\n                const numLabels = labels.length;\n                const step = 1 / (numLabels - 1);\n                const activeIndex = Math.round(percent / step);\n\n                labels.forEach((label, idx) => {\n                    const dot = label.querySelector('div');\n                    if (idx === activeIndex) {\n                        label.classList.remove('text-zinc-600');\n                        label.classList.add('text-white', 'font-bold');\n                        if(!dot) {\n                            label.innerHTML += `<div class=\"absolute -bottom-3 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-1 h-1 bg-white rounded-full opacity-100 transition-opacity\"></div>`;\n                        }\n                    } else {\n                        label.classList.add('text-zinc-600');\n                        label.classList.remove('text-white', 'font-bold');\n                        if(dot) dot.remove();\n                    }\n                });\n\n                // Update Image & Dither Effects\n                const rawIntensity = 1 - percent;\n\n                // Adjust image filter\n                const grayVal = rawIntensity * 100;\n                const contrastVal = 1 + (rawIntensity * 0.4);\n                const brightnessVal = 1 - (rawIntensity * 0.2);\n\n                baseImg.style.filter = `grayscale(${grayVal}%) contrast(${contrastVal}) brightness(${brightnessVal})`;\n\n                // Adjust dither opacity based on slider\n                ditherLayer.style.opacity = rawIntensity * 1.5;\n\n                // Optional: subtle scale effect on image based on slider\n                baseImg.style.transform = `scale(${1 + (percent * 0.05)})`;\n            }\n\n            // Event Listeners for Custom Slider\n            function handleMove(clientX) {\n                if (!isDragging) return;\n                const rect = slider.getBoundingClientRect();\n                let x = clientX - rect.left;\n                let percent = x / rect.width;\n                updateUI(percent);\n            }\n\n            slider.addEventListener('mousedown', (e) => {\n                isDragging = true;\n                handleMove(e.clientX);\n            });\n\n            window.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n                if (isDragging) handleMove(e.clientX);\n            });\n\n            window.addEventListener('mouseup', () => {\n                isDragging = false;\n            });\n\n            // Touch support\n            slider.addEventListener('touchstart', (e) => {\n                isDragging = true;\n                handleMove(e.touches[0].clientX);\n            });\n\n            window.addEventListener('touchmove', (e) => {\n                if (isDragging) handleMove(e.touches[0].clientX);\n            });\n\n            window.addEventListener('touchend', () => {\n                isDragging = false;\n            });\n\n            // Initialize\n            updateUI(currentPercent);\n\n            // Add subtle entry animation for the right panel\n            gsap.fromTo(baseImg,\n                { scale: 1.1, opacity: 0 },\n                { scale: 1.025, opacity: 1, duration: 1.5, ease: \"power2.out\" }\n            );\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "synthetic-archives-visualization-continuum-3.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/synthetic-archives-visualization-continuum-3.jpg", "source_name": "synthetic-archives-visualization-continuum-3-DESIGN.md", "views": 203, "forks": 5, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-06-28T07:15:58.590249+00:00"}